IT:
{{TAG:0003:0027:}}Salut,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0008:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Percepisco
qualcosa di speciale in te oggi,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
una specie di{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} fascino magnetico.

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0027:}}Hallöchen,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0008:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Irgendwie bin ich heute besonders
froh, dass ich dich treffe...

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0027:}}Merhaba,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0008:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Şunu söyleyebilir miyim,
bugün sende fazladan,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} şey,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
insanı çeken bir şey var.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Oh!{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} {{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Questo è destino!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:001A:}}È tutto il giorno che ti penso e che
ho una gran voglia di incontrarti!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Huch, das ist aber komisch!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Du bist
heute sogar noch lässiger als sonst...{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
Und es liegt nicht an deiner Frisur!
{{TAG:0003:001A:}}Ich wäre ja schon froh, wenn
ich halb so lässig wäre wie du,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Çok tuhaf!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Bugün bana ekstra havalı görünüyorsun.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
Üstelik sadece saçından değil.
{{TAG:0003:001A:}}Umarım bir gün senin yarın
kadar havalı olabilirim,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Du hast die seltene Gabe, dass
du Leute glücklich machen kannst!{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Hoffentlich lerne ich das auch mal.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}İnsanları mutlu etmek gibi sihirli
bir yeteneğin var!{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Umarım bir gün bana nasıl yaptığını gösterirsin!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}¡Oye, {{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}{{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
¿Por casualidad te gustaría tener
{{TAG:000E:0002:}}{{TAG:0011:0003:0000}}?
Verás,{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}} resulta que he encontrado
un montón bajo un árbol mientras
paseaba. Extraño, ¿no?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}Así que he pensado en compartirl{{TAG:000E:0008:00CD02006F00020061000000}}s
contigo. ¡Toma, aquí tienes!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Oh, {{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}{{TAG:0005:0008:}} !{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:000E:0002:}}{{TAG:0011:0003:0000}} dans
ta collection, ça te dirait ?
Figure-toi que je viens d'en trouver
des tas.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0002:}}Et je me sens d'humeur
généreuse aujourd'hui !{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}

ES:
¡Oye,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
¿Sabes qué?{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
¡Esta noche he soñado contigo!
No recuerdo qué pasaba, {{TAG:0003:0002:}}¡pero
me he levantado con unas ganas
locas de darte un regalito!
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Yo siempre hago caso a mi
subconsciente, así que ¡toma!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
¡Que lo disfrutes, guap{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}}!

FR:
Oh, hello,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} {{TAG:0005:0008:}} !{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Dis, je ressens le besoin impérieux{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}de te faire un cadeau, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}là,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} comme ça.
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Mais qu'est-ce qui m'arrive au
juste ?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}} Bah, peu importe !{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Prends,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
avant que je change d'avis !

IT:
Oh, salut,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Lo so che è un po' bizzarro, {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}{{TAG:0003:0002:}}ma mi
è venuta voglia di farti un regalo!
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Non so il motivo...{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ma non importa.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Prendi questo, {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}ti prego!

DE:
Hallo,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}Ich habe plötzlich Lust,
dir ein Geschenk zu machen!
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Wieso? Weiß ich auch nicht. Nur so.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Aber ist auch egal!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Hier, nimm es.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Ich hoffe, es gefällt dir!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}You're always so nice,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0008:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
I wanted to repay your kindness
with a present!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0005:}} Here—{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}I got you this!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Sen bana hep çok iyi davranıyorsun,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0008:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Ben de iyiliğinin karşılığını
bir hediyeyle vermek istedim!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0005:}}
Al—{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}bunu senin için aldım!

{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Sadece ne kadar harika olduğunu
söylemem gerekiyordu,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0008:}}!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Why am I suddenly so drawn to you?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0027:}}It's like you're made out of super-
glue or something,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0027:}}Non so perché, ma oggi ho solo
voglia di seguirti ovunque tu vada{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
Che mi prende?

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Versprich mir, dass wir für
immer Freunde sein werden!{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
Los, versprich es mir!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}I'm so happy that we're friends!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0027:}}
I've always wanted a best friend,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
you see.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Sono così feliiice che siamo {{TAG:000E:0006:0A0061006D006900630069000C0061006D006900630068006500}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Sono anni che sogno di essere
la migliore amica di qualcuno!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Arkadaş olmamıza çok seviniyorum!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0027:}}
Hep en iyi arkadaşım olsun istemiştim,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
biliyor musun.

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0027:}}I hope that didn't sound weird.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}I just had to let you know how
I feel!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Vermenin almaktan daha güzel olduğu söylenir.{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
Bence bunda kesinlikle doğruluk payı
var,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!
